# Frontend Environment Variables (Production)

# ==============================================
# CRITICAL: Set this in Vercel Dashboard
# ==============================================

# Backend API URL (Render.com URL)
# Will be provided after backend deployment to Render
# Example: https://your-backend-app.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-app.onrender.com

# ==============================================
# DEPLOYMENT NOTES
# ==============================================
# 1. Deploy backend to Render.com first
# 2. Copy the Render backend URL
# 3. Set this environment variable in Vercel dashboard:
#    - Go to Project Settings → Environment Variables
#    - Add: VITE_API_URL = <your-render-url>
#    - Apply to: Production, Preview, Development
# 4. Redeploy frontend if already deployed
#
# ==============================================
# VERCEL DEPLOYMENT SETTINGS
# ==============================================
# Framework Preset: Vite
# Build Command: npm run build (or leave default)
# Output Directory: dist (or leave default)
# Install Command: npm install (or leave default)
# Node Version: 18.x or higher
#
# Environment Variables in Vercel:
# - VITE_API_URL = https://your-backend.onrender.com
